      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's understandable that large groups can't be deleted instantaneously. I feel like large group deletions should be time gated as a security measure against account jackers just deleting groups. Maybe require a 2 week period to delete groups with over 100 members?\n\nAside from that though, yes, group deletion regardless of members and group ownership transfer should both be options that exist. As it stands it becomes unreasonable to ever delete a group once it reaches a certain size, and that is especially a problem when you can only have up to three groups.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
