  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to request the deletion of a group where members are currently enrolled.\n\nI attempted to delete a group that was created for an event, as the event has concluded. However, I couldn't delete the group due to the presence of active members. There are still over 300 members in the group.\n\nIt would be quite cumbersome to individually kick each member. Even though there are members present, is it possible to proceed with the deletion of the group?",
